message: "If you use this tool, please cite it as below. Se usar esta ferramenta, cite-a como indicado abaixo."
type: software
title: "Virtual patients: from IPS to an interactive health timeline"
abstract: >-
  Five fictitious patients stored as HL7 FHIR R4 International Patient Summaries (IPS), with a
  human-readable IPS view and a rules-based converter that turns any IPS into an interactive
  health timeline. Teaching resource of the course Advanced GenAI for Health Professionals
  (Ciência e Letras).
authors:
